            <p>Never use a comma before a coordinating conjunction in a list.</p>
            <p>Do not capitalize “I” in the middle of a sentence.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2>3. Special Cases</h2>

    <p>Numbers and symbols follow specific rules:</p>
    <p class="indent">• Dates: January 1, 2026</p>
    <p class="indent">• Addresses: 123 Main Street, Anytown, USA 12345</p>

