    <p>Correct the following sentences:</p>
    <ol>
        <li class="indent">the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</li>
        <li class="indent">it is a beautiful day, isnt it.</li>
        <li class="indent">she asked, are we there yet?</li>
    </ol>

    <p><strong>Answers:</strong></p>
    <p class="indent">1. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</p>
    <p class="indent">2. It is a beautiful day, isn’t it.</p>
    <p class="indent">3. She asked, “Are we there yet?”</p>
